# Convex MCP: never call `status`

The Convex MCP **`status`** tool (`projectDir` → deployment selector) **hangs / freezes** this agent UI and often never returns.

## Do instead

- Read `CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL` from `.env.local`
- Use `npx convex` CLI (`convex data`, `convex run`, `convex env`, etc.)
- Use other Convex MCP tools only when you already have a `deploymentSelector` from env/CLI — do not obtain it via `status`

## Do not

- Call `user-convex` / plugin Convex **`status`** to “find the deployment”
- Wait on a frozen `Running Status in convex` panel — cancel and use CLI
